          "gm": "<p>An Ariadne Helspider counts as having a number of rerolls to its Attack and Dodge rolls equal to its Willpower bonus (as if it had Prescience Points). After encountering a Helspider that uses these rerolls, characters must pass an Ordinary (+10) Discipline (Composure) Test to not be confused by conflicting memories due to the time-altering effects of the Helspider.</p>"
